abstract: >-
  Standing is a recorded pair: the pipeline produced a terminal and seven halt guards derived from evidence all hold. Without a five-field packet there is no standing. Fluency is not standing. A cochain leftover may feed one guard; it is not an origin-of-standing theorem.
